#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:18
msgid "PHP 8.4: a typed parameter whose default value is null must say so in its type. Add a \"?\" before the type."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:23
msgid "The namespace name belongs to a PHP extension. It only fails on servers where that extension is installed. It usually comes from a bundled library: updating the library (or prefixing its namespace) fixes it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:28
msgid "Names that start with two underscores are reserved for PHP itself. It works today; it would break only if a future PHP version adds a function with the same name. Renaming it removes the risk."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:33
msgid "PHP 8.4: E_USER_ERROR is deprecated in trigger_error(). Throw an exception instead."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:38
msgid "PHP 8.4: the CSV functions want the $escape argument written explicitly, because its default will change. Passing the current default keeps the same behaviour."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:43
msgid "PHP 8.4 removed this extension from PHP itself (IMAP, Pspell and OCI8 moved to PECL). It only keeps working if the host installs the PECL extension. In the plugin, check that the function exists before calling it, so the site shows a message instead of a fatal error."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:48
msgid "PHP 8.5: this function has done nothing since PHP 8.0 (the resource is freed automatically) and is now deprecated. Delete the line."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:53
msgid "PHP 8.4: mysqli_ping() is deprecated. Run the query and reconnect if it fails."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:58
msgid "PHP 8.4: xml_set_object() is deprecated. Pass full callbacks to the handlers instead."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:63
msgid "PHP 8.2: utf8_encode() and utf8_decode() are deprecated. Use mb_convert_encoding()."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:68
msgid "each() no longer exists since PHP 8.0: calling it is a fatal error. Use foreach."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:73
msgid "create_function() no longer exists since PHP 8.0: calling it is a fatal error. Use an anonymous function."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:78
msgid "The old mysql_* functions do not exist since PHP 7.0. In WordPress, use $wpdb."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:83
msgid "mcrypt does not exist since PHP 7.2. Use the OpenSSL functions (data encrypted with mcrypt needs a migration step)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:88
msgid "The mhash functions are deprecated since PHP 8.1 and the MHASH_* constants since PHP 8.5. Use hash()."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:93
msgid "PHP 8.1: strftime() is deprecated. In WordPress, use wp_date()."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:98
msgid "money_format() no longer exists since PHP 8.0. Use NumberFormatter (intl) or number_format()."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:103
msgid "PHP 8.2: \"${var}\" inside a string is deprecated. Write \"{$var}\"."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:108
msgid "Since PHP 8.0 implode() only accepts the separator first: the reverse order is a fatal error."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:113
msgid "Since PHP 8.0, chained ternaries without parentheses are a fatal error. Add parentheses."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:118
msgid "PHP 8.4: E_STRICT is deprecated (it has not been used since PHP 8.0). Remove it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:123
msgid "PHP 8.5: the long cast names are deprecated. Use the short ones: (bool), (int), (float), (string)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:128
msgid "PHP 8.5: the backtick operator is deprecated. Use shell_exec()."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:133
msgid "PHP 8.6: spl_object_hash() is deprecated. Use spl_object_id(). It returns a number instead of a 32-character text, so check any code that stores the result or compares it with a string."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:138
msgid "PHP 8.6: is_double() is an old alias and is now deprecated. Use is_float(), which does exactly the same."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:143
msgid "PHP 8.6: this function is an old alias and is now deprecated. Use is_int(), which does exactly the same."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:148
msgid "PHP 8.6: doubleval() is an old alias and is now deprecated. Use floatval(), which does exactly the same."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:153
msgid "PHP 8.6: the mb_ereg family of functions is deprecated. Use the preg_ functions with the \"u\" modifier, which handle UTF-8 text. mb_regex_encoding() and mb_regex_set_options() can simply be deleted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:158
msgid "PHP 8.6: strcoll() is deprecated because it depends on the server locale. Use Collator from the intl extension, with the language you need."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:163
msgid "PHP 8.6: returning a value from __construct() or __destruct() is deprecated. The value was always ignored, so leave the return without a value."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:168
msgid "PHP 8.6: a return inside finally is deprecated. It silently replaces the value returned by try and swallows exceptions. Move the return out of the finally block."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:173
msgid "PHP 8.6: calling is_a() or is_subclass_of() with a class name as text while the third argument is false is deprecated. With text it always returned false, so check that the value is an object first: the result stays the same."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:178
msgid "PHP 8.5: ending a case of a switch with a semicolon is deprecated. Use a colon."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:183
msgid "PHP 8.3: get_class() without an argument is deprecated. Use self::class or static::class."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:188
msgid "PHP 8.2: creating a property that the class does not declare is deprecated. Declare it in the class."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-phpready-fixes.php:193
msgid "PHP 8.2: callables written as a string like \"self::method\" are deprecated. Use an array with the class name."
msgstr ""

